cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "rdocmetrics: Behavioral Measures for the RDoC Task Battery"
abstract: >-
  The behavioral measures of the RDoC task battery, as the study reports them:
  accuracy, reaction time and omissions per condition, contrasts between
  conditions, post-error slowing, the congruency sequence effect, post-stop
  slowing, stop-signal reaction time and span recall. Each function takes one
  task's trial table and returns one row per subject and session, with times
  in milliseconds.
type: software
